Michael,
for what it worth, I would really really like you to try what you describe.
I think lojban deserves a better typography and I admit that I'm absolutely
unable to imagine what it might look like. I would only know when I'll see
it. I might end up not liking what you describe but I might also discover
that it's something I absolutely love.

I really admire those that have such a strong feeling that the current
Lojban typography is the best one it could be ever be achieved but I'm sure
that there are many that, like me, would like to see lojban move forward
rather than stay in stagnation as it seems to be now.

